t_card_7359776 at $39, then gift_card_7773485 at $67). But I should note this actually consumed your smaller gift card in full and $67 of the larger one, for a $106 total. If you'd expected to preserve some balance on a particular card, tell me and we can review.\n\nWould you like to make any changes to the new booking, or discuss the H9ZU1C situation further? If you'd like, I can also transfer you to a human agent regarding the passenger-removal/cancellation issue, since I wasn't able to resolve it within my available actions.",
